WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Find ADP A:1 in the 1AON ligand list. Check for 27 seed atoms.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.632
Repeat the 4 Å query from the original ligand. Atom centers give 74 hits.

00:00:15.632 --> 00:00:18.000
Whole-residue expansion gives 154 atoms.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.412
The connector resolved author A:1, label chain W, and used the same 27 seeds

00:00:25.412 --> 00:00:27.000
for both runs.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check the 2.546 Å monitor, then save the annotated PNG and measurement CSV.
